  74:../Libraries/Service/CpuGeneric/StdIf/IfxStdIf_DPipe.h ****  * \retval FALSE Returns FALSE if not all the items could be written
  75:../Libraries/Service/CpuGeneric/StdIf/IfxStdIf_DPipe.h ****  */
