  82:../Libraries/Service/CpuGeneric/StdIf/IfxStdIf_DPipe.h ****  *
  83:../Libraries/Service/CpuGeneric/StdIf/IfxStdIf_DPipe.h ****  * \param stdif Pointer to the interface driver object
  84:../Libraries/Service/CpuGeneric/StdIf/IfxStdIf_DPipe.h ****  * \param data Pointer to the start of data
  85:../Libraries/Service/CpuGeneric/StdIf/IfxStdIf_DPipe.h ****  * \param count Pointer to the count of data (in bytes).
  86:../Libraries/Service/CpuGeneric/StdIf/IfxStdIf_DPipe.h ****  * \param timeout in system timer ticks
